Overview: Delhi Public School, Nandyal, is a well-established CBSE-affiliated school with a strong academic reputation in Andhra Pradesh. The school has a student strength of 3,200 and is managed by a dedicated society. While they have adopted some EdTech solutions like Fedena for LMS and Vedantu for robotics, their technology adoption is still in the medium range, with limited integration of AI and modern ERP systems. The school is transitioning from legacy systems and is open to exploring innovative solutions that align with their vision of holistic education.

Opportunities:
  • {"area": "AI Integration", "details": "The school has no current AI adoption. Skila AI can position itself as a leader in AI-driven personalized learning, adaptive assessments, and teacher training modules. A pilot for AI-powered tutoring in Grades 9-12 could be a strong entry point."}
  • {"area": "Modern ERP System", "details": "The school is using an outdated ERP system (Educomp Smartclass). Skila AI can propose a seamless transition to a modern, AI-integrated ERP that handles admissions, fee management, attendance, and parent communication in one platform."}
  • {"area": "Parent and School App", "details": "Currently, the school lacks a dedicated parent or school app. Skila AI can offer a comprehensive app solution for real-time updates, fee payments, attendance tracking, and a digital report card system."}
  • {"area": "STEM and Coding Expansion", "details": "While the school offers basic coding and robotics, there is room for expansion into advanced STEM programs with AI integration. Skila AI can provide a structured curriculum for AI in STEM, machine learning basics for high school students, and teacher training programs."}
  • {"area": "Smart Classroom Enhancement", "details": "The school has 15 smart classrooms but may lack advanced features like interactive AI tutors, virtual labs, or real-time student engagement tools. Skila AI can enhance these classrooms with AI-driven content and analytics."}
  • {"area": "Data-Driven Decision Making", "details": "The school can benefit from AI-powered analytics for student performance tracking, predictive insights for at-risk students, and automated reporting for administrators."}

Recommendations:
  • {"action": "Schedule a meeting with Dr. Anil Kumar and the school\u2019s IT/academic heads to discuss pain points in their current EdTech setup.", "goal": "Understand their specific needs and align Skila AI\u2019s offerings accordingly."}
