  • {"action": "Offer a pilot program for AI-driven personalized learning in one grade (e.g., Grade 10) for 3 months.", "goal": "Showcase tangible results and gather feedback for scaling up."}
  • {"action": "Present a bundled solution combining ERP modernization, AI tutoring, and a parent app at a discounted rate for early adoption.", "goal": "Encourage long-term commitment and partnership."}
  • {"action": "Leverage the school\u2019s existing partnership with Vedantu Robotics to co-brand a STEM+AI initiative.", "goal": "Leverage existing relationships for smoother adoption."}
  • {"action": "Follow up with the school\u2019s correspondent, Mr. Ramesh Kumar, to address any administrative or financial concerns.", "goal": "Ensure all stakeholders are aligned and supportive of the proposal."}

